    "title": "Why Real Estate Needs an Identity Layer",
    "excerpt": "A property can have an address, a survey plan, a title document and a transaction history — and still leave you unable to answer one basic question: do all of…",
    "image": "/images/blog/why-real-estate-needs-an-identity-layer/0.webp",
